      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Controls</b>\nWASD \u2014 move, Shift \u2014 sprint, Space \u2014 jump\nCtrl
    / C \u2014 crouch (crouch + look down to duck under swings)\nLMB \u2014 attack
    / draw bow, RMB \u2014 block / cancel draw\nLMB inside the green window \u2014
    continue combo\n1 \u2014 sword & shield, 2 \u2014 greatsword, 3 \u2014 bow\n4
    \u2014 sword in left hand (RMB attack, LMB block)\nB \u2014 bot mode: Passive
    / Block / Attack / Spar\nH \u2014 toggle help, Esc \u2014 release cursor"
